    <briefdescription>
<para>Canonical shared registry of prompt injection detection patterns. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both <computeroutput>themis::rag::security::PromptInjectionDetector</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>themis::prompt_engineering::PromptInjectionDetector</computeroutput> load the default registry at construction time to ensure pattern parity.</para>
<para>Compile-time enforcement: each detector&apos;s constructor asserts <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_prompt_injection_pattern_registry_1a8d8c31f6da4d0f16d110d53e1e4e02b9" kindref="member">defaultRegistry()</ref>.<ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_prompt_injection_pattern_registry_1a1aacfba35816b0eaf691db5ac14b73a6" kindref="member">patternCount()</ref> == <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1security_1a8bb2198a0b8d0c07327fe3f56266b07c" kindref="member">SHARED_INJECTION_PATTERN_COUNT</ref></computeroutput> (defined below) so that a mismatch triggers a startup failure rather than a silent security regression. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
